C="{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}
\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\fs18 Input to this block is the pace relay command, 1/0 = closed/ open.  This is the normal output of the algorithm and the ouput vector is sent to the \\par
\\par
The calculations in this block are for the combined pace relay in series with the thermostat.\\par
The equipment status is calculated in the yPaceVecGBL vector\\par
1/0 = equipment ON/ OFF\\par
\\par
For the equipment to be ON, both the Pace relay and the thermostat must be ON, if either is OFF, the equipment is off. \\par
}
"
