N.194="const"<2>*2x88<M>
N.195="label"*2x66<M>
n="CT Rating - PACE4 firmware from Teleepoch
is set for 50 amp CT default. If you attach a 100 amp
CT, the sensed value must be x2.2, if using a 50 amp
CT, the sensed value must be x1.2.  If using a 5 amp
CT, the sensed value must be x.12.  PACE4 supports
3 CT's, 5amp, 50amp, and 100amp.  "
